{"path": "/repos/astral-sh/uv/issues/19015/comments", "params": {"per_page": 100}, "body": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/issues/comments/4258622521", "html_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/issues/19015#issuecomment-4258622521", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/issues/19015", "id": 4258622521, "node_id": "IC_kwDOKbIFZc791Ww5", "user": {"login": "nooscraft", "id": 221098, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTA5OA==", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/221098?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/nooscraft", "html_url": "https://github.com/nooscraft", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nooscraft/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nooscraft/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nooscraft/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nooscraft/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nooscraft/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nooscraft/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nooscraft/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nooscraft/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nooscraft/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-04-16T08:46:40Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-16T08:46:40Z", "body": "If I'm not mistake, I believe this is intentional behavior right now, though I can see why it's confusing. On Windows ARM64, uv deliberately prefers x86_64 Python downloads over native aarch64 because most Python packages still don't ship aarch64 Windows wheels. Running x86_64 Python under emulation gives you better package compatibility out of the box.\n\nYou can see this reflected in `uv python list` too, the aarch64 downloads only show up with `--all-arches`.\n\nRegarding `UV_PYTHON=arm64`, it is a valid value (it parses as aarch64), but it gets overridden by `--python 3.13` and the positional `3.13` argument in your commands. `UV_PYTHON` acts as a fallback for the `--python` flag, so an explicit CLI argument always wins.\n\nTo force a native aarch64 install, you can specify the full platform key:\n\n```\nuv python install cpython-3.13-windows-aarch64-none\nuv venv --python cpython-3.13-windows-aarch64-none --seed --managed-python\n```\n\nOr set `UV_PYTHON=cpython-3.13-windows-aarch64-none` without passing `--python` separately.\n\nThat said, it might be worth reconsidering this default as more packages add aarch64 Windows support, or at least making the preference easier to configure without needing a full platform key.", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/issues/comments/4258622521/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/issues/comments/4260225157", "html_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/issues/19015#issuecomment-4260225157", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/issues/19015", "id": 4260225157, "node_id": "IC_kwDOKbIFZc797eCF", "user": {"login": "zanieb", "id": 2586601, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODY2MDE=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2586601?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb", "html_url": "https://github.com/zanieb", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-04-16T12:57:30Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-16T12:57:30Z", "body": "Hi! That's the default behavior on arm because the arm Windows ecosystem does not have sufficient packages for an arm interpreter to be the default experience yet. You can opt-in, e.g., with `uv python install 3.13-aarch64`", "author_association": "MEMBER", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/issues/comments/4260225157/reactions", "total_count": 1, "+1": 1, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/issues/comments/4260228539", "html_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/issues/19015#issuecomment-4260228539", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/issues/19015", "id": 4260228539, "node_id": "IC_kwDOKbIFZc797e27", "user": {"login": "zanieb", "id": 2586601, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODY2MDE=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2586601?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb", "html_url": "https://github.com/zanieb", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/events{/privacy}", "received_events_u